# SYNTHETIC. A real FETCH arrives across many reads; a machine that only ever sees whole
# responses in tests deadlocks the first time one does not arrive whole. Delivered one byte at
# a time, asserting the machine asks to read again between each.
S: * OK Gimap ready
C: a001 UID FETCH 1 (UID FLAGS)
SPLIT
S: * 1 FETCH (UID 101 FLAGS (\Seen \Flagged))
S: a001 OK Success
DONE
